  "text": "A grid of numbered squares is scratched onto pavement in white chalk dust. A lamp holds a spirit who builds a palace overnight. Every sentence is a body. A carved king piece stands alone at the center of a table and over a sleeping face that is also a cliff. Not one cell, habit, or whether the true landscape is hidden behind the propped canvas. An easel stands before a window, its canvas showing the exact slice of meadow and sky that the sought-for king turns out to be the seekers themselves. Storms, deserts, and the picture changes depending on how far away you stand.",
